The important idea is: **Playwright is just another tool the agent can call.**

## Example internal tool contract

```ts
type SageInvoiceResult = {
  source: "sage-api";
  invoiceNumber: string;
  recordNo: string;
  customerId: string;
  amount: number;
  requestXml: string;
  responseXml: string;
};

type DashboardInvoiceResult = {
  source: "dashboard-ui";
  invoiceNumber: string;
  visibleCustomer: string;
  visibleAmount: number;
  visibleStatus: string;
  screenshotPath: string;
};
```

Then merge them:

```ts
type InvoiceComparison = {
  invoiceNumber: string;
  sage: SageInvoiceResult;
  dashboard: DashboardInvoiceResult;
  matches: {
    amount: boolean;
    customer: boolean;
    status: boolean;
  };
};
```

